OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunny intervals and
OL,6,Fblustery showers, these heavier and
OL,7,Fmore frequent across Argyll with the
OL,8,Fchance of thunder. Winds will be a
OL,9,Ffresh westerly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThere will continue to be a
OL,12,Fmixture of occasional showers, some
OL,13,Fheavy, along with a few clear
OL,14,Fintervals. Fresh to strong westerly
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FSaturday will be another day
OL,18,Fof frequent showers, heavy at times,
OL,19,Fand some sunny intervals. A windy day
OL,20,Fwith west to northwesterly gales at
OL,21,Ffirst over Isles and western coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
